<?php /** @var array<string,mixed> $a */ /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $signatures */ /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $files */ /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $events */ /** @var bool $canManage */ /** @var bool $canSign */ /** @var bool $canUpload */
$u = '/agreements/' . $a['public_id']; $lab = ['draft' => 'Draft', 'sent' => 'Sent, waiting for signatures', 'partially_signed' => 'Partly signed', 'executed' => 'Executed', 'cancelled' => 'Cancelled', 'expired' => 'Expired'];
$signed = array_column($signatures, 'party'); $open = in_array($a['status'], ['draft', 'sent', 'partially_signed'], true); ?>
<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow"><a href="/agreements">Agreements</a></p><h1><?= e($a['reference']) ?> · <?= e($a['title']) ?></h1><p class="muted"><?= e($lab[$a['status']] ?? $a['status']) ?> &middot; <?= $a['mode'] === 'online' ? 'signed online' : 'signed on paper' ?> &middot; <a href="/clients/<?= e($a['client_public_id']) ?>"><?= e($a['client_name']) ?></a><?= $a['project_public_id'] ? ' &middot; <a href="/projects/' . e($a['project_public_id']) . '">' . e($a['project_code']) . '</a>' : '' ?></p></div>
    <div class="actions"><?php if ($a['mode'] === 'online') : ?><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="<?= e($u) ?>/document">Download PDF</a><?php endif; ?>
    <?php if ($canManage && $a['status'] === 'draft' && $a['mode'] === 'online') : ?><form method="post" action="<?= e($u) ?>" class="inline-form" data-confirm="Send this agreement to the client for signature? The text can no longer be changed."><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="send"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send to client</button></form><?php endif; ?></div></div>
<?php if ($a['mode'] === 'online') : ?><div class="panel"><h2>Text</h2><div class="prewrap agreement-text"><?= e($a['body']) ?></div><p class="muted">Fingerprint (SHA-256): <code><?= e($a['body_sha256']) ?></code><?= $a['template_name'] ? ' &middot; from template ' . e($a['template_name']) . ' v' . (int) $a['template_version'] : '' ?></p></div><?php endif; ?>
<div class="panel"><h2>Signatures</h2><?php if ($signatures === []) : ?><p class="muted">Nobody has signed yet.</p><?php endif; ?>
    <ul class="plain"><?php foreach ($signatures as $s) : ?><li><strong><?= e(ucfirst((string) $s['party'])) ?></strong>: <?= e($s['signer_name']) ?> &middot; <?= e(local_time($s['signed_at'])) ?> &middot; <?= e($s['method']) ?><?= $s['ip'] ? ' &middot; from ' . e($s['ip']) : '' ?></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul>
    <?php if ($a['mode'] === 'online' && $canSign && in_array($a['status'], ['sent', 'partially_signed'], true) && !in_array('company', $signed, true)) : ?>
        <form method="post" action="<?= e($u) ?>" class="form-grid" data-confirm="Sign this agreement for the company?"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="sign_company"><h3>Sign for the company</h3>
            <div class="field"><label for="tn">Your full name</label><input id="tn" name="typed_name" required maxlength="160"></div><div class="field"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="declare" value="1" required> I have read this agreement and I sign it for the company.</label></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="pw">Your password</label><input id="pw" name="confirm_password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Sign</button></div></form><?php endif; ?></div>
<?php if ($a['mode'] === 'physical' || $files !== []) : ?><div class="panel"><h2>Signed copies (vault)</h2>
    <?php if ($files === []) : ?><p class="muted">No scan uploaded yet.</p><?php endif; ?>
    <ul class="plain"><?php foreach ($files as $f) : ?><li>Version <?= (int) $f['version_no'] ?> &middot; <a href="<?= e($u) ?>/files/<?= (int) $f['version_no'] ?>"><?= e($f['original_name']) ?></a> (<?= e(\Vertex\Services\FileStore::humanSize((int) $f['size_bytes'])) ?>) &middot; <?= e(local_time($f['created_at'])) ?> by <?= e($f['uploaded_by_name'] ?? '-') ?><?= $f['note'] ? ' &middot; ' . e($f['note']) : '' ?><br><span class="muted">SHA-256 <?= e($f['sha256']) ?></span></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul>
    <?php if ($canUpload && $open) : ?><form method="post" action="<?= e($u) ?>" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="form-grid"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="upload">
        <div class="field"><label for="f">Signed scan (PDF, PNG or JPG)</label><input id="f" name="file" type="file" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" required></div><div class="field"><label for="n">Note <span class="muted">(optional)</span></label><input id="n" name="note" maxlength="255"></div>
        <div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Upload as a new version</button></div></form><?php endif; ?>
    <?php if ($canSign && $a['mode'] === 'physical' && $open && $files !== []) : ?><form method="post" action="<?= e($u) ?>" class="form-grid"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="executed"><h3>Mark as executed</h3>
        <div class="field"><label for="so">Date signed</label><input id="so" name="signed_on" type="date" required></div><div class="field"><label for="cs">Client signatory</label><input id="cs" name="client_signer" required maxlength="160"></div><div class="field"><label for="co">Company signatory</label><input id="co" name="company_signer" required maxlength="160"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="nn">Note</label><input id="nn" name="note" maxlength="500"></div><div class="field"><label for="p2">Your password</label><input id="p2" name="confirm_password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Mark executed</button></div></form><?php endif; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($canManage && !in_array($a['status'], ['executed', 'cancelled'], true)) : ?><div class="panel"><h2>Cancel</h2><form method="post" action="<?= e($u) ?>" class="form-grid" data-confirm="Cancel this agreement?"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="cancel"><div class="field"><label for="r">Reason</label><input id="r" name="reason" required maxlength="255"></div><div class="field"><label for="p3">Your password</label><input id="p3" name="confirm_password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" type="submit">Cancel agreement</button></div></form></div><?php endif; ?>
<div class="panel"><h2>History</h2><ul class="plain"><?php foreach ($events as $ev) : ?><li><?= e(local_time($ev['created_at'])) ?> · <?= e($ev['actor'] ?? 'System') ?> · <?= e($ev['detail']) ?></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul></div>
